# musubi's output is the owner's documents, cleaned. The WHOLE destination is
# one classification (ADR-0019): documents/, traces/ and manifest.json are the
# same secret, and a trace map is not the safe half -- it carries the owner's
# filenames, the length and position of every paragraph, and which tracking
# parameters were in the document. Named by directory rather than by filename,
# because a rule that matches `*.trace.json` misses `traces/a.md.json`.
out/
synced/
**/documents/
**/traces/
**/manifest.json
.musubi-staging/
